Use the **flow-reviewer** subagent to run the **`ux-flow-review`** heuristic canon on $ARGUMENTS:
the five frameworks (Shneiderman · Tognazzini · Gerhardt-Powals · Rams · Weinschenk), the {{DOMAIN}}
overlay (trust signals, amount/fee clarity, confirmation on irreversible actions, no dark patterns),
and WCAG 2.2 AA. Evaluate both the screen composition and the flow sequencing.

Return the skill's output: snapshot · flow-health scorecard · findings grouped blocker → major →
minor with evidence + fix · prioritized fix list · what's working. WCAG AA failures and "flow can't
complete its goal" are blockers. A real {{SYSTEM_NAME}} component defect is a DS gap, not a finding — route it.

Defer to the agent + skill — do not restate the frameworks here.
